node.doctext:
Thank you Haukex, you’re always helping me out. Works great. I have no idea what you did but it gives me a place to start and learn. 
<p>
Follow up question. I’m trying to print this out to a file but I’m getting errors about print usage.   This is what I did 
</p>
<code>
open my $fh, "<:encoding(utf8)", "output.csv" or die "output.csv: $!";
my $csv = Text::CSV->new({binary=>1, auto_diag=>2, eol=>$/,
    always_quote=>1 });
$csv->print($fh, (select, ["sku", @columns]));
for my $sku (sort keys %$itms) {
    $csv->print($fh, (select, [$sku, map { $itms->{$sku}{$_} } @columns ]));
}
</code>

Thanks again
